{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>CHERNOBOTS</u></i></strong>\u00a0is a retro 3D roguelite, allowing endless exploration of the dangerous and procedurally generated Chernobyl Exclusion Zone following the nuclear power plant disaster. Search for highly radioactive targets that are top priority for removal. Drive and operate remote controlled robots equipped with cameras, radiation detectors, adjustable arms, deployable traps and more to get the job done. Avoid being destroyed by mutated animals or pay the price. Earn money for completing tasks and upgrade your robotics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679190/extras/1ee02b18c5c73a4c7e69c9a909e21599.avif?t=1774372927\" width=615 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE various PROCEDURALLY GENERATED areas within the CHERNOBYL EXCLUSION ZONE following the NUCLEAR POWER PLANT DISASTER: Pripyat City, Red Forest, and Power Plant locations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEARCH areas that are different every time</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIND radioactive targets that are top priority for RETRIEVAL and REMOVAL</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AVOID</strong>\u00a0<strong>mutated animals, HUNT them or be HUNTED</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EARN money for completing tasks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE drivable remote controlled robots with explosives, melee weapons, deployable traps &amp; more</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BET on and WATCH animal races to win more money</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVEIL areas of the Zone via automated drones</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER\u00a0intel pick ups that tell a deeper story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ADJUST robot arms and INTERACT with physics-based objects\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANAGE your expenses and decontamination costs\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUY upgrades for your robots and MORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679190/extras/7010bff5e2ccc217857f423a53d8848f.poster.avif?t=1774372927\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679190/extras/7010bff5e2ccc217857f423a53d8848f.webm?t=1774372927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679190/extras/7010bff5e2ccc217857f423a53d8848f.mp4?t=1774372927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>SEARCH DIFFERENT AREAS OF THE CHERNOBYL EXCLUSION ZONE EVERY TIME</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679190/extras/e1885d14c934a232d7527a56b25b4b1d.poster.avif?t=1774372927\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679190/extras/e1885d14c934a232d7527a56b25b4b1d.webm?t=1774372927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679190/extras/e1885d14c934a232d7527a56b25b4b1d.mp4?t=1774372927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>RETRIEVE TOP PRIORITY RADIOACTIVE TARGETS FOR REMOVAL</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><v